  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific 2023 Diplomatic Training Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity seeks to deliver introductory level diplomatic training to cohorts of up to 35 scholars consisting new recruits or junior-level staff from Pacific Foreign Ministries or related agencies. Training modules include
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Introduction to international diplomacy, tradecraft, protocol, and consular services&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Trade policy, bilateral trade agreements&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Pacific regional architecture&#xA0;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Climate change and natural resource diplomacy&#xA0;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;
among other important topics related to international diplomacy.</narrative>
  </description>
